WEBVTT

00:06.550 --> 00:09.620
The plan is progressing on schedule.

00:10.370 --> 00:11.950
That is good fortune.

00:12.650 --> 00:15.610
Blessings to our new homeland.

00:16.550 --> 00:19.540
And joyful death be upon our enemies.

00:20.530 --> 00:22.710
The time is nigh.

00:23.530 --> 00:25.040
Glory to Unoid.

00:37.090 --> 00:39.640
Drat... I was careless.

00:40.770 --> 00:43.390
The Puppeteer... That guy...

00:44.910 --> 00:47.490
Seems like the preparations are done.

00:48.100 --> 00:50.240
Do you like it?

00:50.640 --> 00:54.610
After all, that mask is my latest
custom-made one.

00:54.610 --> 00:58.050
This will be the final performance in our trope.

01:00.060 --> 01:02.750
Oh, fret not, my child.

01:02.750 --> 01:07.000
For now, you will not be told to improvise,
nor read certain lines...

01:07.000 --> 01:10.000
Each one of you will act freely...

01:10.000 --> 01:13.050
Nay, this is no acting,

01:13.050 --> 01:16.810
but the true self
acted out by the actors.

01:17.390 --> 01:19.680
All of you are excellent actors.

01:20.090 --> 01:24.230
You will never be able
to displease the audience.

01:24.780 --> 01:26.560
Now, witness for yourselves!

01:26.560 --> 01:32.990
The true improvisation interwoven by
the stringless puppets!

01:38.700 --> 01:41.750
METALLIC ROUGE

03:03.910 --> 03:04.610
Rouge!

03:05.410 --> 03:06.460
You're safe!

03:06.460 --> 03:07.540
Jean!

03:11.180 --> 03:12.270
You okay?

03:12.840 --> 03:16.740
I was able to escape among
the chaos caused by your attack.

03:17.180 --> 03:19.750
I knew you'd come for me.

03:20.130 --> 03:21.640
Thanks, Rouge!

03:21.640 --> 03:22.260
Jean...

03:22.260 --> 03:22.850
Huh?

03:23.110 --> 03:24.930
I know where the id is!

03:24.930 --> 03:26.710
The Altar is definitely wrong.

03:26.710 --> 03:28.420
- We'll create a world
- Hey, is this...

03:28.420 --> 03:30.520
- where Neans are equal
- Yep, no doubt.

03:30.520 --> 03:31.980
to humans...

03:35.090 --> 03:36.850
What are you doing, Rouge?!

03:36.850 --> 03:40.030
I didn't recall raising you to be violent!

03:40.030 --> 03:42.030
I wasn't even raised by you!

03:42.030 --> 03:43.660
You mocking us?

03:43.660 --> 03:47.110
No way we'd fall into
the same trap every time!

03:47.110 --> 03:49.970
Ugh, how boring.

03:49.970 --> 03:52.840
You could've humoured me a little bit.

03:53.680 --> 03:57.430
I've already prepared
a dramatic line after this.

03:57.790 --> 03:59.620
Beat it! Where's Jean?!

03:59.620 --> 04:00.970
Let me take you to him.

04:01.420 --> 04:05.170
To Jean Yunghart.

04:05.170 --> 04:06.390
What do you mean?

04:06.920 --> 04:09.770
I just want to enjoy it more.

04:09.770 --> 04:13.450
You know how our queen is, no?

04:14.790 --> 04:17.450
She's so stubborn and humourless.

04:17.450 --> 04:17.896
She's so stubborn and humourless.
On the other hand,
you two are humour incarnations.

04:17.896 --> 04:20.640
On the other hand,
you two are humour incarnations.

04:20.640 --> 04:23.110
A bundle of jokes and comical faces.

04:23.110 --> 04:24.310
Is he praising us?

04:24.310 --> 04:25.590
No way!

04:25.590 --> 04:27.870
I don't want to hear that from you!

04:28.200 --> 04:30.720
Life is a series of choices.

04:30.720 --> 04:34.130
It is up to you to believe it or not.

04:35.940 --> 04:37.080
7 of heart...

04:37.720 --> 04:39.430
Opening up the future...

04:40.020 --> 04:41.390
You two...

04:41.710 --> 04:44.190
...should be able to arrange
this long, boring play...

04:44.190 --> 04:48.350
...with a lot of fun.

04:48.350 --> 04:50.850
Now, follow me.

04:54.730 --> 04:56.190
Someone's fighting up there.

04:57.510 --> 04:58.380
Eden?

05:12.400 --> 05:17.530
Hey, why don't we just call it a draw?

05:18.050 --> 05:20.300
Those in the way of Sylvia...

05:20.660 --> 05:23.800
One cannot let them breathe!

05:24.180 --> 05:26.000
No matter what?

05:26.000 --> 05:28.350
Those causing pain to Sylvia...

05:28.350 --> 05:30.230
One cannot forgive!

05:33.140 --> 05:36.150
Thou shalt know pain thyself, dear friend!

05:36.940 --> 05:38.850
Take this!

06:10.550 --> 06:11.860
How careless...

06:12.550 --> 06:15.300
This won't solve anything.

06:15.300 --> 06:17.570
Sylvia's methods are wrong.

06:17.950 --> 06:20.010
You should know yourself.

06:20.730 --> 06:24.810
How contemptible...
What use inquiring that now?

06:24.810 --> 06:28.490
Time shan't go back,
nor be returned to.

06:28.900 --> 06:31.650
This body and soul...

06:31.650 --> 06:34.540
...already belongs to one's true love.

06:34.860 --> 06:38.630
So does yours, does it not, Noir?!

06:39.440 --> 06:41.120
Stop, Graufon!

06:41.120 --> 06:45.090
Live for love, and die for love!

06:53.680 --> 06:54.940
What the heck?

06:57.470 --> 07:01.350
Live for love, and die for love, eh?

07:03.030 --> 07:05.610
They truly are boring folks.

07:06.370 --> 07:08.270
Now, let us come forth.

07:08.850 --> 07:09.570
Rouge.

07:21.000 --> 07:23.760
Gosh... What a stupid man.

07:24.610 --> 07:26.380
So are you.

07:26.760 --> 07:28.040
No doubt.

07:29.180 --> 07:30.030
Please...

07:31.320 --> 07:33.460
Stop...

07:34.310 --> 07:37.180
Sylvia...

07:43.700 --> 07:46.070
Yeah... I promise.

07:48.330 --> 07:49.340
Another one...

07:50.360 --> 07:52.420
Could they both be...

07:52.800 --> 07:53.600
In the past...

07:54.730 --> 07:58.130
If among the nine,
one were to start a fight,

07:58.130 --> 08:00.150
you'd step in right away.

08:01.150 --> 08:03.570
Please, lend me your power.

08:04.420 --> 08:05.970
To save Sylvia.

08:06.810 --> 08:08.520
But I...

08:09.390 --> 08:12.510
You said it's for us to survive,
eh, you jerk Aes?

08:12.850 --> 08:15.600
You, a spineless coward,
would've died right away.

08:15.600 --> 08:19.510
If you're dead, so am I.

08:19.970 --> 08:21.730
Stop involving people in your problem.

08:22.290 --> 08:26.590
By living, it means choosing for yourself.

08:27.510 --> 08:29.030
Believe in yourself.

08:30.370 --> 08:32.510
Believe in yourself...

08:35.100 --> 08:37.880
You said there might be another way.

08:38.280 --> 08:39.530
Do you really think so?

08:39.970 --> 08:41.360
We should be able to find it.

08:42.582 --> 08:43.620
A new way.

08:44.450 --> 08:46.010
A better one.

09:00.440 --> 09:03.190
You curious about the black reactor?

09:03.190 --> 09:04.470
Nah.

09:04.470 --> 09:07.570
Hey, are we there yet?

09:07.570 --> 09:10.350
Oh, where are we?

09:10.350 --> 09:11.360
Huh?

09:11.650 --> 09:16.150
Excuse me, seems like we're lost here.

09:16.150 --> 09:17.500
I knew it...

09:17.880 --> 09:20.750
Oh, come on, don't be so mad.

09:20.750 --> 09:25.320
We get lost in the labyrinth of life
every day.

09:25.320 --> 09:26.920
What a cliched line.

09:27.310 --> 09:29.240
How can I tell?

09:29.570 --> 09:31.510
Because it has no essence.

09:31.510 --> 09:33.590
How can I tell?

09:33.950 --> 09:38.150
Because you are an essenceless being.

09:38.150 --> 09:43.190
Isn't this harsh? Even though I brought
you your guests, as asked.

09:43.810 --> 09:47.400
Using someone's face and imitating them...

09:47.400 --> 09:50.190
...only to long for someone else.

09:50.570 --> 09:52.150
What a boring man.

10:00.050 --> 10:01.580
Oh?

10:01.930 --> 10:03.970
I loathed you.

10:04.520 --> 10:06.630
That's nice.

10:21.190 --> 10:22.150
Noir!

10:26.930 --> 10:28.690
We need your power.

10:33.830 --> 10:35.200
Please lend it to us.

10:37.720 --> 10:38.530
I beg you.

10:39.990 --> 10:40.790
Father.

10:46.040 --> 10:48.420
The improvisation play is ending.

10:48.810 --> 10:52.050
The final segment is drawing near.

10:52.350 --> 10:55.130
Yes... You will be the main cast.

10:56.050 --> 11:00.340
Script? Oh, I didn't mention it, did I?

11:00.340 --> 11:03.140
Your role does not need a script.

11:03.550 --> 11:07.650
Your role is to stand on stage
and close the curtains.

11:08.090 --> 11:09.950
That is all.

11:11.190 --> 11:12.950
I'll give you one last chance.

11:13.390 --> 11:15.470
Become our ally.

11:15.870 --> 11:19.010
Give your life for your fellow Neans.

11:19.010 --> 11:20.030
Life?

11:20.720 --> 11:22.570
Your id is the analyser...

11:23.180 --> 11:25.250
The Decryptor's main unit.

11:25.530 --> 11:28.210
Once set, nothing can remove it.

11:28.980 --> 11:31.030
In order to save Neans,

11:31.510 --> 11:33.490
be proud and sacrifice yourself.

11:33.490 --> 11:35.010
Nah, I'd pass.

11:35.550 --> 11:36.600
Besides...

11:40.210 --> 11:43.400
If I die, I can't eat
Broma Chocolate anymore.

11:45.610 --> 11:46.460
Eden!

11:47.130 --> 11:48.440
And Jean Yunghart...

11:49.450 --> 11:50.150
You...

11:50.940 --> 11:51.650
Aes?

11:52.380 --> 11:55.280
He's an ally.
He just saved me.

11:56.510 --> 11:58.410
If you shoot me with that gun,

11:58.780 --> 12:00.570
you'll be the one dying.

12:02.260 --> 12:04.290
Alice!

12:04.800 --> 12:06.290
S-Sorry...

12:07.550 --> 12:10.330
Anyway, I saw it!

12:10.930 --> 12:12.750
The Puppeteer guy.

12:13.350 --> 12:15.600
His real face...

12:16.590 --> 12:18.670
Let us proceed, then.

12:19.040 --> 12:21.850
Close the curtain for the old play.

12:22.360 --> 12:27.350
And raise the curtain for the new world!

12:33.640 --> 12:35.940
#12 MASK GRAVEYARD

12:46.100 --> 12:48.750
Please, don't lose, Rouge.

12:49.850 --> 12:52.990
Do you know the life expectancy
of the Neans on Venus?

12:54.670 --> 12:55.670
3 years.

12:56.190 --> 12:58.800
They can only live for 3 years!

13:00.850 --> 13:03.700
Even those with huge physics...

13:03.700 --> 13:06.420
...could not withstand
the hellish environment.

13:06.830 --> 13:09.560
So many of our comrades lost their lives.

13:10.090 --> 13:11.790
This very Venus...

13:12.410 --> 13:14.360
...shared the same fate as Mars.

13:15.190 --> 13:16.230
A former battlefield.

13:17.390 --> 13:20.700
Jean said if the Neans were free,
the world would be in chaos,

13:20.700 --> 13:22.670
and a war would break out.

13:23.290 --> 13:24.950
But he's wrong.

13:28.350 --> 13:30.000
The war is still ongoing!

13:30.780 --> 13:32.750
Between humans and Neans!

13:33.090 --> 13:35.750
Ever since the nine of us were born!

13:36.860 --> 13:37.930
I'm begging you...

13:38.640 --> 13:41.510
If you lose, I have to...

13:49.320 --> 13:49.930
Nice!

13:52.150 --> 13:55.430
You can't win against me
with my free will!

13:55.950 --> 13:57.710
Not a chance!

14:03.070 --> 14:07.390
You're just a string puppet
loyal to any order!

14:07.880 --> 14:08.830
Rouge!

14:10.410 --> 14:11.650
You're wrong.

14:14.100 --> 14:17.000
I chose this myself!
It's my own free will!

14:17.500 --> 14:18.300
Then...

14:18.970 --> 14:20.420
No hard feelings, eh?!

14:25.620 --> 14:28.420
Since you chose to die yourself.

14:48.920 --> 14:52.590
Before you stop functioning,
you'd better witness...

14:53.010 --> 14:55.290
...the moment the world changes.

14:57.910 --> 15:00.400
Damn... it...

15:04.950 --> 15:06.110
Naomi...

15:06.990 --> 15:09.930
Give me... your hand...

15:10.810 --> 15:11.650
Naomi...

15:14.830 --> 15:15.770
Naomi?

15:16.770 --> 15:18.080
Naomi!

15:20.210 --> 15:21.710
Stupid Naomi...

15:28.210 --> 15:30.880
I knew you'd prioritise your order.

15:35.490 --> 15:36.920
You poor thing.

15:37.690 --> 15:41.040
You could've just lived
your life freely like me.

15:41.490 --> 15:44.580
Looking for the reactor's control room?

15:45.480 --> 15:47.260
It should be straight ahead.

15:51.620 --> 15:52.970
Why did you save me?

15:52.970 --> 15:54.270
Save?

15:54.690 --> 15:57.930
I told you, I just want to have fun.

15:57.930 --> 16:00.800
Until I stop breathing, beating,

16:00.800 --> 16:04.550
and all my functions stop working.

16:05.370 --> 16:09.410
If the girl fails,
release the reactor's failsafe,

16:09.410 --> 16:12.870
and stop Code Eve from activating
by destroying the whole plantation...

16:13.370 --> 16:15.810
...is what they said to you, no?

16:15.810 --> 16:17.480
Very interesting.

16:17.480 --> 16:21.690
The Visitors do come up
with such a fancy plan.

16:23.050 --> 16:25.710
I can't wait to see...

16:25.710 --> 16:28.930
...which future you will choose,
Naomi Orthmann.

16:29.600 --> 16:30.680
Or rather...

16:31.100 --> 16:32.920
Adieu, First.

16:45.220 --> 16:46.600
Access granted.

16:47.160 --> 16:48.630
Releasing safety lock.

16:49.280 --> 16:51.530
- Change to the input wave authorised.
- Sorry about this.

16:51.530 --> 16:54.510
You're trying to stop me so desperately,

16:54.510 --> 16:57.810
but I made sure
they can't hear your voice.

16:58.600 --> 17:00.610
Yeah, yeah, it's dangerous.

17:01.510 --> 17:02.580
30 percent.

17:03.530 --> 17:04.836
Warning.

17:04.970 --> 17:06.358
- The input energy level
- Explosive danger, eh...

17:06.358 --> 17:07.720
- is exceeding the safe mark.
- Explosive danger, eh...

17:07.720 --> 17:09.960
What will happen if we all explode?

17:10.540 --> 17:15.050
Surely we all will be doomed.

17:15.050 --> 17:15.164
All of us...

17:15.164 --> 17:17.358
Warning.

17:17.358 --> 17:20.164
The input energy level
is exceeding the safe mark.

17:21.760 --> 17:24.836
70 percent. 80 percent.

17:27.540 --> 17:28.836
Warning.

17:28.836 --> 17:30.790
- Rouge...
- Please reduce the input energy

17:30.790 --> 17:32.840
below the safe mark.

17:33.810 --> 17:37.000
Warning.
The input energy...

17:37.000 --> 17:38.200
...is exceeding 80 percent.

17:38.200 --> 17:41.040
Ah, gosh! I get it already!

17:42.290 --> 17:44.030
Rouge! Rouge!

17:44.560 --> 17:46.710
Rouge! Rouge!

17:46.710 --> 17:48.150
Rouge!

17:49.040 --> 17:52.010
Rouge!

17:52.650 --> 17:54.300
Over here...

17:55.050 --> 17:55.590
Huh?

17:56.470 --> 17:59.850
Over here, you stupid Naomi...

18:00.730 --> 18:01.710
You were alive...

18:02.550 --> 18:03.340
Oh?

18:05.910 --> 18:06.650
Sorry!

18:08.070 --> 18:09.780
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

18:10.590 --> 18:13.750
I won't ask where you've been,

18:13.750 --> 18:16.290
but you sure you want
to come back to me?

18:17.120 --> 18:19.290
Don't you have something to do?

18:20.150 --> 18:22.290
Is that your logical decision?

18:23.710 --> 18:25.020
I don't know...

18:26.000 --> 18:28.260
This isn't logical at all.

18:29.090 --> 18:33.080
It doesn't make sense,
yet it doesn't go against my order.

18:34.350 --> 18:37.000
Am I broken...?

18:38.010 --> 18:40.100
I don't really get it...

18:40.450 --> 18:43.710
I guess that's what a friend is.

18:44.750 --> 18:45.750
Friend?

18:46.430 --> 18:50.710
We might actually be
behaving like humans now...

18:51.780 --> 18:53.760
So what's the plan?

18:56.340 --> 18:59.270
I've decided to go with you.

19:11.680 --> 19:13.670
Hey, what are you doing?!

19:14.100 --> 19:15.720
Eden was fine for a while...

19:16.310 --> 19:18.300
So I should be as well...

19:19.030 --> 19:20.680
Wrap it up quick...

19:21.230 --> 19:22.450
...and get it back to me.

19:35.990 --> 19:36.970
Graufon...

19:38.510 --> 19:41.120
I wish you were by my side
in your final moments...

19:42.860 --> 19:45.330
Jean Yunghart has escaped?

19:46.770 --> 19:49.350
I guess Alcos of the Twin Heads
has betrayed us.

19:54.880 --> 19:56.350
It does not matter.

19:57.930 --> 20:00.180
Now is the time for our world.

20:04.630 --> 20:05.670
How could you?

20:06.270 --> 20:07.120
Rouge!

20:09.740 --> 20:12.110
No way...
You gave her your id?!

20:15.190 --> 20:16.170
Are you insane?

20:16.170 --> 20:17.770
I just lent her.

20:17.770 --> 20:18.620
You guys!

20:19.030 --> 20:20.680
Ash! Aes!

20:21.960 --> 20:23.540
Don't worry, Rouge.

20:23.910 --> 20:25.790
Jean and Eden are safe.

20:29.810 --> 20:31.130
Is this some kind of terminal?

20:31.130 --> 20:32.830
It belongs to the Usurpers.

20:34.720 --> 20:39.190
I've done a lot of research
on the stuff they left on Mars.

20:39.190 --> 20:43.650
Well, those two ladies
called me a tomb raider, though.

20:43.650 --> 20:45.320
It's data for Code Eve.

20:46.020 --> 20:47.180
Still...

20:47.870 --> 20:48.690
No way...

20:49.660 --> 20:50.440
Where's Cyan?

20:50.710 --> 20:51.690
Well...

20:52.070 --> 20:53.220
About that...

20:53.220 --> 20:57.570
My job is to gather the poor puppets.

20:57.990 --> 21:02.200
And release them,
thus saving them.

21:03.390 --> 21:04.130
Rouge!

21:04.950 --> 21:08.210
He's Roy Yunghart the professor!

21:14.470 --> 21:16.420
Do you think you are free...

21:16.920 --> 21:18.560
Rouge Redstar?
